       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. P-50-NESTED-EVALUATE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 A PIC 9 VALUE 2.
01 B PIC 9 VALUE 3.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
EVALUATE A
 WHEN 1 DISPLAY "A1"
 WHEN 2
  EVALUATE B
   WHEN 3 DISPLAY "A2-B3"
   WHEN OTHER DISPLAY "A2-OTHER"
  END-EVALUATE
 WHEN OTHER DISPLAY "OTHER"
END-EVALUATE
STOP RUN.
